  triage:title "Boundary TOML stale allowed_dependents" ;
  triage:description "rust-qa-agent/ruthless-boundary-qa flagged a stale allowed_dependents entry in the boundary manifest touched by the peer-tls module rehome (feature/pao-s1-tls-module-rehome, PR #942). The entry 'atm-peer-tls-interop' in atm-storage/peer-config-store.toml is stale: atm-peer-tls-interop does not depend on PeerConfigStore, and the fixture-only interop crate should not be in allowed_dependents after the production peer-tls implementation was added." ;
